### Modularity Requirements
- Files should not exceed 200 lines (MANDATORY)
- Break down trading logic into logical, reusable modules
- Separate concerns: entry logic, exit logic, safety checks
- Each module must have clear purpose documentation

### Trading Bot Architecture Patterns
- Core trading logic centralized in `trading_bot_core.py`
- Separate daemons for different responsibilities
- Use async/await for API calls and blockchain interactions
- Implement circuit breakers for API rate limits

